<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-022> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-022 — isoperimetric/minimal-area hollow & aggregate partitions (Ophiurid pluteus; plant tissue partitions; pollen; radiolarian analogues (Commons))",
        "Thompson (1917) T1917-022 — isoperimetric/minimal-area hollow & aggregate partitions faithfully reproduces Ophiurid pluteus; plant tissue partitions; pollen; radiolarian analogues (Commons) morphology" ;
