    dct:description "The simulation script(s) thompson/claims/t1917-022_the-forms-of-tissues-continued.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Ophiurid pluteus; plant tissue partitions; pollen; radiolarian analogues (Commons) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/thompson/claims/t1917-022_the-forms-of-tissues-continued.py> ;
