<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-022-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-022 — isoperimetric/minimal-area hollow & aggregate partitions — MorphoEval overall 53.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline: Lean laws E1-E5 pinned; Thompson IA plates vendored; initial script lacked robust junction-angle metrology and full parameter sweeps; catch-all claim scored as split structures. Overall 53.1/100 (faithfulness 46.3, reproducibility 68.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit a8bae15d56cf26f6d31eb8cd1b41b5301fdde110; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 40, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 42, Source and data traceability 78, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_022_the_forms_of_tissues_continued_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-022_the-forms-of-tissues-continued.py at a8bae15d56cf26f6d31eb8cd1b41b5301fdde110, image/png, 1645444 B, 2100×1350 px, artifact_sha256 722cf2379c51dfd982a3af4d4bdd5e8173b7a559e26ceb72b8140aa898f35035 (sha256 722cf2379c51dfd982a3af4d4bdd5e8173b7a559e26ceb72b8140aa898f35035), spec_fingerprint d5662788b05b86432d342a16505bcc2afe5c80c3c960513c6c22811bd6065d39. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d5662788b05b86432d342a16505bcc2afe5c80c3c960513c6c22811bd6065d39; artifact_sha256: 722cf2379c51dfd982a3af4d4bdd5e8173b7a559e26ceb72b8140aa898f35035; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-022/scout_manifest.json=a3a033535db37a98..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-022/t1917_022_the_forms_of_tissues_continued_reference.json=81a2311b2af01bda..., morphoeval/lean/loops/Thompson1917_T1917_022.lean=9420d08a3db775ab...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add GOF RMSE/r/KS between froth model and tissue junction samples; write result.json verdict.",
        "remediation needed: Fix Plateau junction-angle metrology and froth raster gradient pipeline.",
        "remediation needed: Improve Fig. 176 radial voting and pollen circularity segmentation." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.31e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

